    "gitMarketplace.error.localDataDamaged.stateUnreadable": "Ave cannot open the {source} source's record of the version it trusts. Repair downloads it again and trusts the version the source serves now, without checking it against the one you had. To keep that check instead, make sure your account can read and write the Ave data folder. Otherwise, in Sources, choose Repair.",
