    "gitMarketplace.error.unreachable.notFound.setToken.managed": "{host} reports no repository at this source's address, which is also how hosts answer for a private repository without sign-in. If you have access to it, use Set token… on the source's row in Sources to add a token for {host} that can read it; otherwise tell your administrator.",
    "gitMarketplace.error.unreachable.notFound.readd": "{host} reports no repository at this source's address, which is also how hosts answer for a private repository without sign-in. Use Remove source on its row in Sources and add it again: with the right address, or with Sign-in set to Access token if the repository is private.",
